<title>USA: Zag Industries Q1 shr $0.21 vs $0.19.</title>
<headline>Zag Industries Q1 shr $0.21 vs $0.19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.21		    $0.19</p>
<p> Net			  1,823		    1,204</p>
<p> Revs			15,359		   10,855</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,805		    6,370</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The company said Q1 sales were a record and resulted from new products, the addition of new retailers and expanded relationships with existing customers. Higher revenues were also driven by higher than expected volume in Europe and the United States.</p>
</text>
